menu "Valve head"

    config VALVE_TRAVEL_MS
        int "Motor run time for a full stroke (ms)"
        default 3300
        help
            Time the lock motor needs for the 7.1 mm stroke (scaled from 1600 ms for 3.4 mm). Measure it once; the motor
            runs this long plus VALVE_OVERRUN_MS and then stalls against the hard stop.

    config VALVE_OVERRUN_MS
        int "Extra run time against the hard stop (ms)"
        default 500

    config VALVE_REVERSE_DEFAULT
        bool "Swap motor direction by default"
        default n
        help
            Same as swapping the two motor wires. This is only the factory default of the
            "Reverse direction" switch the device exposes over Matter; once that switch has
            been set, its stored value wins.

endmenu
